  {
   "label": "dfn-pointerType-dt",
   "site": "dfn id=\"dom-pointerevent-pointertype\"",
   "rawLine": 1697,
   "rawCharRange": [
    0,
    334
   ],
   "raw": "                    <dt><dfn data-export=\"\" data-dfn-type=\"attribute\" id=\"dom-pointerevent-pointertype\" data-idl=\"attribute\" data-title=\"pointerType\" data-dfn-for=\"PointerEvent\" data-type=\"DOMString\" data-lt=\"pointerType\" data-local-lt=\"PointerEvent.pointerType\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\"><code>pointerType</code></dfn></dt>",
   "sha256": "86320d95b565aafce3203e7501eb666ad06f987b5ff0a50cc835b58ef5721f46",
   "note": "Definition site anchor for pointerType",
   "textNormalized": null
  },
  {
   "label": "dfn-pointerType-prose",
   "site": "dd of dfn id=\"dom-pointerevent-pointertype\" (raw 1697-1699)",
   "rawLine": 1699,
   "rawCharRange": [
    0,
    435
   ],
   "raw": "                            <p>Indicates the device type that caused the event (such as mouse, pen, touch). If the user agent is to <a href=\"#dfn-fire-a-pointer-event\" class=\"internalDFN\" data-link-type=\"dfn\" id=\"ref-for-dfn-fire-a-pointer-event-1\">fire a pointer event</a> for a mouse, pen/stylus, or touch input device, then the value of <code>pointerType</code> <em class=\"rfc2119\">MUST</em> be according to the following table:</p>",
   "sha256": "d48ec5248b4bf19d987f8faf5d695755e4337b009f4f2136249918447b901207",
   "note": "Definition prose: device type that caused the event, naming mouse, pen, touch; the value set is normative via the table (raw 1705-1707)",
   "textNormalized": null
  },
  {
   "label": "pointerType-value-mouse",
   "site": "table id=\"pointer-type-table\" row 1",
   "rawLine": 1705,
   "rawCharRange": [
    0,
    86
   ],
   "raw": "                                    <tr><td>Mouse</td><td><code>mouse</code></td></tr>",
   "sha256": "9c5ce2c20a09be6d76b39f1b16e903cc3ecf77c6217bd4b4a99a54f8c32d6ce8",
   "note": "Mouse -> mouse",
   "textNormalized": null
  },
  {
   "label": "pointerType-value-pen",
   "site": "table id=\"pointer-type-table\" row 2",
   "rawLine": 1706,
   "rawCharRange": [
    0,
    91
   ],
   "raw": "                                    <tr><td>Pen / stylus</td><td><code>pen</code></td></tr>",
   "sha256": "2f15f049a0c2c8d4b689e1793eeab212f516f33d51f247e714cdae3df608c19f",
   "note": "Pen / stylus -> pen",
   "textNormalized": null
  },
  {
   "label": "pointerType-value-touch",
   "site": "table id=\"pointer-type-table\" row 3",
   "rawLine": 1707,
   "rawCharRange": [
    0,
    94
   ],
   "raw": "                                    <tr><td>Touch contact</td><td><code>touch</code></td></tr>",
   "sha256": "cce4932ecf7b8f538018c5d25cfea09c3bef74a79ee11188bd15a33daa7e57dc",
   "note": "Touch contact -> touch",
   "textNormalized": null
  },
  {
   "label": "idl-pointerId",
   "site": "pre id=\"webidl-1641249507\", span data-idl class=\"idlAttribute\" data-title=\"pointerId\" data-dfn-for=\"PointerEvent\"",
