  },
  {
   "label": "dfn-pointerId-dt",
   "site": "dfn id=\"dom-pointerevent-pointerid\"",
   "rawLine": 1630,
   "rawCharRange": [
    0,
    319
   ],
   "raw": "                    <dt><dfn data-export=\"\" data-dfn-type=\"attribute\" id=\"dom-pointerevent-pointerid\" data-idl=\"attribute\" data-title=\"pointerId\" data-dfn-for=\"PointerEvent\" data-type=\"long\" data-lt=\"pointerId\" data-local-lt=\"PointerEvent.pointerId\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\"><code>pointerId</code></dfn></dt>",
   "sha256": "a2698d2983410f5132b21b89bfff8d106cfe6ae743f45f2de89b9ba5dc8f0734",
   "note": "Definition site anchor for pointerId",
   "textNormalized": null
  },
  {
   "label": "dfn-pointerId-prose",
   "site": "dd of dfn id=\"dom-pointerevent-pointerid\" (raw 1630-1632)",
   "rawLine": 1632,
   "rawCharRange": [
    0,
    793
   ],
   "raw": "                            <p>A unique identifier for the pointer causing the event.  <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#user-agent\">user agents</a> <em class=\"rfc2119\">MAY</em> reserve a generic <a data-link-type=\"idl\" data-lt=\"pointerId\" href=\"#dom-pointerevent-pointerid\" class=\"internalDFN\" id=\"ref-for-dom-pointerevent-pointerid-2\"><code>pointerId</code></a> value of <code>0</code> or <code>1</code> for the primary mouse pointer. The <a data-link-type=\"idl\" data-lt=\"pointerId\" href=\"#dom-pointerevent-pointerid\" class=\"internalDFN\" id=\"ref-for-dom-pointerevent-pointerid-3\"><code>pointerId</code></a> value of <code>-1</code> <em class=\"rfc2119\">MUST</em> be reserved and used to indicate events that were generated by something other than a pointing device.",
   "sha256": "229904ac19ca8fdc1db99cd93d8028675369a61d9bae43548b2511e646a3efef",
   "note": "Definition prose incl. reserved -1 for events generated by something other than a pointing device",
   "textNormalized": null
  },
  {
   "label": "pointerdown-section-heading",
   "site": "section id=\"pointerdown\", h4 id=\"x3-3-3-pointerdown\", dfn id=\"dfn-pointerdown\"",
